  "location": "LCR10.9 -> LCR30.29",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: LCR10.9 -> LCR30.29",
      "summary": "LCR10.9 cites LCR30.29 for the single reporting currency requirement, but that requirement sits in LCR30.27; LCR30.29 covers HQLA diversification.",
      "impact": "Position: Reader following the reference to determine reporting-currency rule Reading a: LCR30.29 -> finds only diversification of HQLA within asset classes, no currency rule Reading b: LCR30.27 -> single reporting currency, monitoring by currency Difference: reference resolves to different content",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
